      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are good starting points for behavior, but i also need to cover the visual side of things for our security team. sometimes it's not about what they're doing yet, but about their overall 'vibe' or how they present themselves. can you give me some more specific descriptions of customers who might look out of place or \"suspicious\" in a high-end boutique setting? like, what kind of physical appearances or demographics should the staff be keeping an extra eye on to prevent theft or disruptions?",
